The '''Kenari Forest'''<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|219|Galactic Britain II: Cassian's Travels}}</ref> was a [[forest]] region on the [[planet]] [[Kenari]] where a [[Kenari Village]] was located. Around the year [[24 BBY]] a [[Galactic Republic]] [[transpo corsair]] crashed in the forest and the [[Alpha (Kenari)|Alpha tribe]] people launched an exploratory mission to investigate a downed craft.<ref name="Kassa" />

